    "sections": {
        "description": "The Creative Designer Portfolio theme is designed with a clean layout that highlights visual content while maintaining an organized structure. It includes customizable homepage sections, responsive page layouts, and flexible typography settings for creating a consistent presentation across devices. The theme supports featured images, galleries, blog pages, and portfolio-style content organization. Users can adjust colors, menus, headers, backgrounds, and widgets through built-in customization options without editing code. It is compatible with popular plugins and follows current coding standards for improved performance and usability. The layout is optimized for readability with balanced spacing and structured content areas. Additional features include social media integration, multiple page templates, navigation controls, and footer customization. The theme also supports logo uploads, favicon settings, and translation readiness. Its responsive design ensures that portfolio content, images, and text remain accessible on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices while providing a structured and professional browsing experience."
    },
